として使用したいので、背景を入れず、キャラクターの一部を切り取らないように描いてください！\n\n金額が足りない場合は再送をお願いします！この度はありがとうございました꒰ᐢ..ᐢ꒱\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bJE0D6XiXOXIQUYPT4jjMrjZlPl6o1N4?usp=drive_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@p_p0p0p/works/148", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/74a49d82/uploads/origins/cb4c8702-f160-490c-8a32-5ce08ec055e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fcf03fbc9ccea694b56cee21d3e29c75", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/74a49d82/uploads/origins/cb4c8702-f160-490c-8a32-5ce08ec055e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fcf03fbc9ccea694b56cee21d3e29c75, https://si.imgix.net/74a49d82/uploads/origins/cb4c8702-f160-490c-8a32-5ce08ec055e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1aebd93560703305edd7fb64f1020f38 2x, https://si.imgix.net/74a49d82/uploads/origins/cb4c8702-f160-490c-8a32-5ce08ec055e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74e64f34992b77416cd120b8af3772f8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "このキャラクターのキュートでセクシーなイラストを描いてください！\n\nhttps://i.ibb.co/JWKhKrf5/SPOILER-portrait.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@p_p0p0p/works/147", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6bdd6443/uploads/origins/e38b7b49-e1df-4982-8586-33dd58e65223?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=060495faed15412a60b5e01357485682", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6bdd6443/uploads/origins/e38b7b49-e1df-4982-8586-33dd58e65223?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=060495faed15412a60b5e01357485682, https://si.imgix.net/6bdd6443/uploads/origins/e38b7b49-e1df-4982-8586-33dd58e65223?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fe0495ed217812fb9f011ecd029da9ba 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6bdd6443/uploads/origins/e38b7b49-e1df-4982-8586-33dd58e65223?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompr